  <NAME>Homo sapiens</NAME>
  <TITLE>Heterogeneity in neurodegenerative disease</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>RNA was purified from fusiform gyrus tissue sections of autopsy-confirmed Alzheimer's cases and neurologically normal age-matched controls. The "SAM.ID" sample characteristic is a sample identifier internal to Genentech. The ID of this project in Genentech's ExpressionPlot database is PRJ0007261 Overall design: RNA from fusiform gyrus of Alzheimer's or Neurologically Normal post-mortem tissue.</DESCRIPTION>
